WEBVTT

00:08:26.397 --> 00:08:30.398
and they lost 30 percent of their orders overnight.

00:08:30.398 --> 00:08:31.784
Now in a large manufacturing company,

00:08:31.784 --> 00:08:33.325
this is a big deal,

00:08:33.325 --> 00:08:36.172
and they could no longer afford their labor pool.

00:08:36.172 --> 00:08:37.875
They needed to save 10 million dollars,

00:08:37.875 --> 00:08:39.898
so, like so many companies today,

00:08:39.898 --> 00:08:43.292
the board got together and discussed layoffs.

00:08:43.292 --> 00:08:44.916
And Bob refused.

00:08:44.916 --> 00:08:49.168
You see, Bob doesn't believe in head counts.

00:08:49.168 --> 00:08:52.609
Bob believes in heart counts,

00:08:52.609 --> 00:08:55.117
and it's much more difficult to simply reduce

00:08:55.117 --> 00:08:56.847
the heart count.

00:08:56.847 --> 00:08:59.854
And so they came up with a furlough program.

00:08:59.854 --> 00:09:01.945
Every employee, from secretary to CEO,